      "additional_text": "Sandsworn Sandals\n1. 35% increased Movement Speed\n2. 18% increased [ItemRarity|Rarity of Items] found\n3. +45% to [Resistances|Lightning Resistance]\n4. 8% increased Movement Speed\n5. 32% increased [Armour|Armour], [Evasion|Evasion] and [EnergyShield|Energy Shield]\n6. Your speed is unaffected by [Slow|Slows]\n7. [ShamanOnlyMods|Bonded]: 8% increased Movement Speed\n8. [ShamanOnlyMods|Bonded]: +32 to maximum Life\n9. [ShamanOnlyMods|Bonded]: +32 to maximum Mana\n10. [ShamanOnlyMods|Bonded]: 16% increased [CooldownRecovery|Cooldown Recovery Rate]",
